          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>년　 월　 일　 시경</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="3"><text:p>거주조－ No</text:p><text:p>－</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>대피 장소</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>대피소　·　재택　·　기타　(　　　　　　　　　　)</text:p><text:p>※차내 대피자는 주차 장소도 기재해 주십시오.</text:p></table:table-cell>
