          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>※자치회 미가입자는 '미가입(未加 入)'으로 기재</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
