          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>대피소에</text:p><text:p>계신 분께</text:p><text:p>○</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>후리가나</text:p><text:p>(※ 한자 위에 읽는 법을</text:p><text:p>표기하는 것) 성　명</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>나이</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>성별</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>가족관</text:p><text:p>계</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>비고</text:p><text:p>※요(要)배려자의 번호와</text:p><text:p>특히 배려가 필요한 사항을</text:p><text:p>기재</text:p></table:table-cell>
